      "message": "test(ui): feedback reads the clear-toolpath undo hint through chord()\n\nThe status line now names the platform's command key, so on macOS it\nsays \"Cmd+Z restores\"; the feedback suite still matched \"Ctrl+Z\" and\nfailed there. Assert through shortcut_keys::chord like the twin does.\n\nRefs #1239\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
