      "message": "fix(ui): pick hints read the command key on macOS\n\nThe click-to-add pick hints (Edge mode hint, the \"Click selects\" hover,\nthe boundary pick help) said Ctrl, but the picks read mods.command\n(Cmd on macOS, #1238). They now build the word through command_key() /\nchord(); EDGE_HINT and boundary HINTS become fns. Adds the pure\ncommand_key_for(macos) so both answers are tested on any host, and a\ntest pinning the three hints. Corrects the decision record, which\nclaimed those picks read mods.ctrl.\n\nRefs #1239\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
